      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "寒さで倒れていたサウラさんを助けてから数日後。\n僕は再び彼女と一緒に湖畔へと遊びにきていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "7660e341ab37a29149f5c99dea7a9b3eb8f632209df95942ea0da6f3def0214f",
