      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "うふふ、いい天気だね～ご主人くん。\n今日は日差しが温かいから、\n私とっても元気だよ～！",
      "jp_sha256": "07b46d37ed711d4e41a189805d2d7576042082abaa2318403b14933851db6c96",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "우후후, 날씨 좋네~ 주인 군.\n오늘은 햇볕이 따뜻해서,\n나 아주 건강해~!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 37,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "f7be317ae96df0ff6d642979f561834db1bf8ea7f4c42856b932921e6eeae91f:000002_235081782889145163:g0:r36",
      "row_index_0based": 36,
      "serialized_row_index": 36,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "サウラ",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "うふふ、いい天気だね～ご主人くん。\n今日は日差しが温かいから、\n私とっても元気だよ～！",
