      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あははは。それはよかったです。\n前は一緒に遊ぶどころか、\nゆっくり散歩すら出来なかったですからね。",
      "jp_sha256": "7a9fe1d7018e5f6e9060d235dac3a3d37972bf05b892fe42b9b8bb5bab506066",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아하하하. 다행이네요.\n전에는 함께 놀기는커녕,\n느긋하게 산책조차 못 했으니까요.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 38,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "f7be317ae96df0ff6d642979f561834db1bf8ea7f4c42856b932921e6eeae91f:000002_235081782889145163:g0:r37",
      "row_index_0based": 37,
      "serialized_row_index": 37,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "あははは。それはよかったです。\n前は一緒に遊ぶどころか、\nゆっくり散歩すら出来なかったですからね。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "386818e769a3ed7a9b9bcdffebecd64d46b1caefc7ed29a4bc96b71689cff938",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "むぅ～、その話はなしなし！\n私としたことがご主人くんに迷惑をかけちゃって、\nけっこう真面目に反省しているんだからね～。",
      "jp_sha256": "7c160f6bf0d2feef7a0c76bd39cfadee7e551ef63fa7fdf3d6633aa45a303165",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "으음~, 그 얘기는 없던 걸로!\n나답지 않게 주인 군에게 폐를 끼쳐서,\n꽤 진지하게 반성하고 있단 말이야~.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 40,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
