      "row_index_0based": 40,
      "serialized_row_index": 40,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そう言ってぷくりと頬を膨らませるサウラさん。\n本人には申し訳ないけれど、その表情はかなり可愛い。\n思わず、からかいたくなってしまう。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "1fbfdda681a7f463c85866af3643cc840ee67868d0ab2a041a041ba9e979288a",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "じゃあ、今日はサウラさんの素敵なところを見せてください。\n前の印象と相殺、ということでどうです？",
      "jp_sha256": "fed657fa9548af85a732365ee124aba6c904d141eefbb6798d2ccfb8ac640302",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그럼 오늘은 사우라 씨의 멋진 모습을 보여 주세요.\n전의 인상과 상쇄하는 걸로 어때요?",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 42,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "f7be317ae96df0ff6d642979f561834db1bf8ea7f4c42856b932921e6eeae91f:000002_235081782889145163:g0:r41",
      "row_index_0based": 41,
      "serialized_row_index": 41,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "じゃあ、今日はサウラさんの素敵なところを見せてください。\n前の印象と相殺、ということでどうです？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "acfc3191c9b208718b05888bd164af4c1dcd0052ef68dcb70d2fbb03e1b949f4",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ええ～、素敵なところ？\nそんなことを言われてもお姉さん困っちゃう。",
      "jp_sha256": "97a75d83e280869a404cfb0a7e1f173bbd08a18400b969d69b8e9d05ab789fd0",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "에에~, 멋진 모습?\n그런 말을 들어도 누나는 곤란한데.",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 43,
